Why does the author mention the story with the dog?','[{"title":"Варіанти відповіді","options":[{"marker":"A","text":"to warn against riding a bike with a pet","images":[]},{"marker":"B","text":"to prove that multitasking brings no good","images":[]},{"marker":"C","text":"to entertain the reader with a funny story","images":[]},{"marker":"D","text":"to express sympathy for the poor animal","images":[]}]}]','b','Пояснення
