Dans Le Noir, London
It’s a novel concept where diners are served meals in complete darkness. Visitors must rely on their server for everything. Guests are guided to the table by the waiters armed with night view binoculars. Then the waiters take customers’ dietary preferences, and after that the idea is to lose all control over one’s meal and give oneself over to just experiencing it. This concept restaurant currently has branches in nine cities around the world.
This restaurant ________.','[{"title":"Варіанти відповіді","options":[{"marker":"A","text":"has the staff wearing the other profession uniform","images":[]},{"marker":"B","text":"takes advantage of garden-to-plate food supply","images":[]},{"marker":"C","text":"organises culinary talent contests","images":[]},{"marker":"D","text":"uses an original delivery mechanism","images":[]},{"marker":"E","text":"popularises national cuisine","images":[]},{"marker":"F","text":"makes use of returnable containers","images":[]},{"marker":"G","text":"offers meals coupled with excursion tours","images":[]},{"marker":"H","text":"equips its waiters with hi-tech devices","images":[]}]}]','h','Пояснення
