At this futuristic eatery, the wait staff is a thing of the past. Guests place their orders via a touch-screen computer at each table. When the food is ready, it zips to the table along a twisting track from the kitchen above directly to the guests at their tables. Dishes are covered and strapped well onto the trays so that they don’t go flying across.
This restaurant ________.','[{"title":"Варіанти відповіді","options":[{"marker":"A","text":"has the staff wearing the other profession uniform","images":[]},{"marker":"B","text":"takes advantage of garden-to-plate food supply","images":[]},{"marker":"C","text":"organises culinary talent contests","images":[]},{"marker":"D","text":"uses an original delivery mechanism","images":[]},{"marker":"E","text":"popularises national cuisine","images":[]},{"marker":"F","text":"makes use of returnable containers","images":[]},{"marker":"G","text":"offers meals coupled with excursion tours","images":[]},{"marker":"H","text":"equips its waiters with hi-tech devices","images":[]}]}]','d','Пояснення
