Larry Sorel, director of the Seneca Park Zoo in Rochester, New York, says balconies can be inviting places for raccoons to shelter, especially if food (31)________ out. “Raccoons are great climbers – they can get almost (32)________ with their human-like hands,” Sorel says. “But I’m surprised this raccoon climbed quite so high!”','[{"title":"Варіанти відповіді","options":[{"marker":"A","text":"has arrived","images":[]},{"marker":"B","text":"arrived","images":[]},{"marker":"C","text":"had been arriving","images":[]},{"marker":"D","text":"have arrived","images":[]}]}]','b','Пояснення
 ТЕМА: Використання мови. Уміння правильно використовувати граматичні форми частин мови й частини мови відповідно до контексту.
